# Deep, one-sided binary trees freed whole (Phase 2 on l2r-base7: upstream Reussir frees a type with two recursive
# fields with its destructor executor, which keeps a frame per level: at 10^6 nodes every mode peaked at 111 MB, native
# 39 MB, dev with the old drop patches 37 MB). Peak memory at 10^6 within native's plus 4000 KB; allocations and bytes
# as native's.
tl 250000 | tl 1000000 | 1 2000 | rss 1 4000
tr 250000 | tr 1000000 | 1 2000 | rss 1 4000
tlu 250000 | tlu 1000000 | 1 2000 | rss 1 4000
tru 250000 | tru 1000000 | 1 2000 | rss 1 4000
